          <p>Blanket Order for maintenance & repair of Police vehicles for Public Safety from Campus Auto Repair. Campus Auto Repair is a preferred vendor for police vehicles due to their close proximity to campus. They provide emergency and routine maintenance for police vehicles at a reasonable cost.</p>
          <p>General Funds - Public Safety Operations</p>
          <p>This bid waiver is to support the increase of PO P0992320 by $15,000, from $24,000 to $39,000. Public Safety has incurred a higher level of repairs than anticipated. Individual repairs are substantially lower than the blanket order total but the cumulative total exceeds the University threshold of $25K.</p>
